        "ij4iplwcurst"
       ],
       "text": "Saint Catherine"
      },
      {
       "_key": "5xorxrr6cc2z",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " in Egypt involves a few different options, each with its own considerations. Here’s a breakdown of the various ways to reach this unique destination:"
