     "level": 1,
     "listItem": "bullet",
     "markDefs": [],
     "style": "normal"
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000019",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000018",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Private Bus to St. Catherine’s"
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [],
     "style": "h2"
    },
    {
     "_key": "00000000001d",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "00000000001a",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "For Mount Sinai Climbers:"
      },
      {
       "_key": "75e1rgy5sttf",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " Organized trips are available from Dahab, Nuweiba, and "
      },
      {
       "_key": "mw7cpp5lnygm",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "g4evhoi6pwmc"
       ],
       "text": "Sharm El Sheikh"
      },
      {
       "_key": "mikifkrro152",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " for tourists aiming to climb Mount Sinai. These buses typically leave late in the evening (around 11 PM from Dahab/Nuweiba or 10 PM from Sharm El Sheikh) and return the following morning after the climb."
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000001c",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "\n"
      }
     ],
     "level": 1,
     "listItem": "bullet",
     "markDefs": [
      {
       "_key": "g4evhoi6pwmc",
       "_type": "internalLink",
       "reference": {
        "_ref": "wp-page-58927",
        "_type": "reference"
       }
      }
     ],
     "style": "normal"
    },
    {
     "_key": "00000000001f",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "00000000001e",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Taxis to St Catherine’s"
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [],
     "style": "h2"
    },
    {
     "_key": "00000000002a",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000020",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "strong"
       ],
       "text": "From Dahab, Nuweiba, or Sharm El Sheikh:"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000021",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " If you plan to spend a few days in St Catherine and are coming from these locations, taxis are a viable option. "
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000022",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " "
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000023",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "From Sharm El Sheikh, take a public bus to Dahab, then negotiate a taxi to St Catherine (around 450 LE for a one-way trip, about 2 hours)."
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000024",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " "
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000025",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "From Nuweiba, the cost and distance are similar."
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000026",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " "
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000027",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "A direct taxi from Sharm El Sheikh to St Catherine can cost around 1100 LE."
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000028",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " "
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000029",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " "
      }
     ],
     "level": 1,
     "listItem": "bullet",
     "markDefs": [],
     "style": "normal"
    },
    {
